      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我终于意识到了那违和感的来历。\r\n我终于理解了这最为重要的事情——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bf65340997d8025c6319c5b341e97c047e240950a8fe862dec97c13b0281ec0",
