    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cc0bcd4d73c7187c8eb989",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看不见的理由——我已经思考了许多。\r\n“观测镜被蒙上了雾气”“太黑了”，\r\n甚至是“正好存在于死角”等等……",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ce2833164d0f1f882a93baf9eaf611be54e57fb818d5759dcc6fd88ae1943c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
